MDL402, G1: routines is an option without argument. mydumper turns
"routines=0" into "--routines 0": the flag is set and "0" is a stray
argument, so routines ARE dumped (compare mdl402-control-defaults).
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/mydumper.cnf --host mysql --user e2e --password e2e-password --database app
lint: MDL402
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: 0
expect routines-dumped: true
-- mydumper.cnf --
[mydumper]
routines=0
